#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""spoor — waitpid is a lie; the wake of a command is the object.

A command is not done when its pid reaps. It is done when descendants,
temp files, and the watched tree go still. spoor records that wake:
late writes, leaked processes, leftover paths, and tests that collided
on the same filesystem heap.
"""

